,"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:239166","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"yozuca*","creatorId":"vndb:s612","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s612","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s612","name":"yozuca*","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:172028","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Rin'ca","creatorId":"vndb:s8804","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8804","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8804","name":"Rin'ca","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:172031","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"天海 向日葵","creatorId":"vndb:s11945","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11945","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11945","name":"天海 向日葵","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:172032","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c95371","characterName":"早乙女 愛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90641","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"323788"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23416"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95371"},"originalCharacterName":"早乙女 愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first-year high schooler, she is the childhood friend of Yuuto, and is one year younger than him. She is fairly mature for girls her age, and knows how to maintain a respectful distance from other people, generally speaking. Has never had a boyfriend in her life, and is in love with Yuuto."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has always had trouble studying, and when her parents saw no other way for her grades to improve, they arranged a private tutor for her. That tutor was our protagonist. He helped Ai realize the joy of studying, and with his help, her grades improved. This also acted as the trigger for Ai's romantic feelings to bud for Yuuto. Afterwards, she worked really hard to get enrolled into the same school as Yuuto."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves him, but also finds it really cute when he gets flustered so she frequently plays pranks on him to see that side of his. Whenever she teases Yuuto (be it by making sexual advances on him or through embarrassing punishment games) she always stays composed as she pre-prepares herself for the embarrassing bits, but in reality, if not ready, she is just as simple as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95371"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園１年で、主人公のひとつ年下の幼馴染。相手の価値観を尊重出来る子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は今どきの女の子といった風だが、同年代に比べて幾分大人びた考えのしっかりとした女の子。恋愛の経験は無く、主人公が初恋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は成績も良くなかったのだが、心配した両親に頼まれて家庭教師をした主人公が勉強の楽しさを教えてくれた事をキッカケに成績も向上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それがキッカケで主人公に対しても好意を抱くようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後主人公と同じ学園へ進学するため、勉強も頑張るように。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことは好きなのだが、慌てる姿が可愛いかったのでついからかってしまうように。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分主導でえっちなからかいや罰ゲームなどをするのは大丈夫なのだが(事前に心構えをしてるため)攻められる側に回ると途端に恥ずかしくなる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23416","sourceWorkId":"30549","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園１年で、主人公のひとつ年下の幼馴染。相手の価値観を尊重出来る子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は今どきの女の子といった風だが、同年代に比べて幾分大人びた考えのしっかりとした女の子。恋愛の経験は無く、主人公が初恋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は成績も良くなかったのだが、心配した両親に頼まれて家庭教師をした主人公が勉強の楽しさを教えてくれた事をキッカケに成績も向上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それがキッカケで主人公に対しても好意を抱くようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後主人公と同じ学園へ進学するため、勉強も頑張るように。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことは好きなのだが、慌てる姿が可愛いかったのでついからかってしまうように。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分主導でえっちなからかいや罰ゲームなどをするのは大丈夫なのだが(事前に心構えをしてるため)攻められる側に回ると途端に恥ずかしくなる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90641"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/198ffe565da19e9d313c2967838717dd2c47168db4ceb15abd8c5edbf64cc08e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6cdafcbf05119865e5636e64521ff852b2db2f2d0f3292e82419b922e6566596.webp","width":85,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:323788:90641:8580:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c97625","characterName":"瑞川 優斗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c97625"},"originalCharacterName":"瑞川 優斗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/081d73c00fb1b26eb92a8248c7caa1ad3ef45208eaed84eb4d6ea25e16aa09b5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45c8eec387c3e358cf45d7a0575ea6676cd82afc78f42187edc6b875c8439bc1.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p4542","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:4340","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p4542","name":"あざらしそふと","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:31644:4340","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p15656","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p15656","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p15656","name":"神乙云","roleCo